{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n\n<p>35歲的2013年港姐冠軍陳凱琳與鄭嘉穎婚後「四年抱三」，育有三名兒子，家庭生活美滿。近年她事業心爆棚，不僅加盟內地綜藝節目《乘風2026》，更親力親為打理香港的朱古力店生意，成為家庭經濟支柱，一直被傳是有錢女的她，私下作風不時引起討論。近日有網民大爆她「慳家」一面，在社交平台分享搭天星小輪時「捕獲」陳凱琳的照片，身為富家女兼明星沒有以名車代步，反而搭平民小輪過海，被網民讚節儉又貼地。面對網民帶同小朋友上前合照，她更爽快應允，雙手放在膝上展現溫柔甜笑，沒有明星架子，被讚真人好靚而且具親和力。</p>\n<h2>陳凱琳「淋Cream」風波引公關災難</h2>\n<p>陳凱琳早前捲入「戲院淋Cream」風波，她帶三名兒子到戲院睇戲，期間兒子被指在場內喧嘩踢凳，引發同場觀眾不滿更遭「淋Cream」，她事隔一天後決定報警備案，至今仍未透露涉事的「淋Cream」女士是否已被捕。當時她曾發聲護子稱：「希望大家可以對小朋友善良少少」，引起網民熱議，形象明顯受損。近日她表現貼地坐天星小輪的行為被放上網，引來網民質疑她借交通工具跟市民近距離接觸，以親民一面挽回形象。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳發文道盡教導小朋友的辛酸，獲得不少家長共鳴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abc4245572d4a7a9d226c98ac433222d/2026-05/3900948593770282162_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳早前為二仔鄭承亮慶祝6歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f376efaf47a129ce94c3fb11660460b7/2026-08/ryrtre_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳讚二仔好pure好真，對身邊所有朋友同家人都係出自真心咁錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/732eb1505355c8fb4c202e179eaf64d8/2026-08/ryrtre_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭嘉穎專心湊仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d942ac72550e79bef079f172daa8cde3/2026-08/ryrtre_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳三名兒子疑在戲院內喧嘩踢凳，惹來淋Cream風波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7071da97b6a5398b285ec79e91dac02/2026-10/V5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳近日乘搭天星小輪過海，又與粉絲合照，被讚親民貼地。成功洗底。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b697669641245436bdef252c9ad7344e/2026-10/_1_momo__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳說：「你呢種性格，真係我哋最大嘅福氣。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb9c6a9b30f1406f355702e0a62fc97c/2026-08/ryrtre_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳家中不時開派對，可以輕鬆一番。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3639cf7856088b2e6e876d34ec6b8cdd/2026-05/3900948597411001637_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭嘉穎近年全職做湊仔公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/263c3626e9f4411bae325c6d8cf67723/2026-05/3900948600397472444_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以往陳凱琳也經常分享家中環境，見到有人工嬰兒床，兩兄弟亦有私家刻名椅子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64678cfa80aeab5a2afe0cff9a310d46/2023-03/ghlchan_336290724_937463074262563_2186221179134673260_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雲石大飯枱起碼夠坐10人。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8abc3449c8c1bd656d550d8eb41f47c0/2023-03/6496571a-44c2-439a-a2dc-e0acdad83b9e.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳設計走簡約風，與以往不同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd12e897fc45d261740ccd59570b429c/2023-03/335760147_1896703074013347_8722195894531697776_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎耀祥一家去年也曾到訪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/655b3258a9f36bc8ec9095bc39d21354/2023-10/kevincheng_official_346037763_3366727470213223_7015356456845770219_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳弟弟回港探望時，亦處畫前留影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84e3e96b15baad58b2fb42eb11f22afd/2023-10/ghlchan_350130995_928018798466545_9057006328839378178_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭嘉穎父親節時親自下廚𠱁兒子們。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2cf0f484d375c74b262394530861a457/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--ghlchanInstagram-0_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"將飯桌當碟令人記憶猶新。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61d820c0a608d5c8625e41d3befc427a/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--ghlchanInstagram-1_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連媽媽陳凱琳也一起吃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdd22597c1c7a69d367edf5fb79f8730/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--ghlchanInstagram-1_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳最愛下廚，廚房都好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf94022328aadc7d6b05c173cc06857e/2023-03/1_6_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"據知張嬰兒床亦要3,000元，而BB身後可出去花園玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37f5d9462a02ccd441bd7abb8a61b9b2/2023-03/ghlchan_336000843_248044520882263_4028383735297883990_n%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳曾在中秋國慶長假期間開Party。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5430b64c231f18505d9ff42789371cce/2023-10/G1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原來是在家中招呼一班賓客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ce0f7648626db2b1314895233427143/2023-10/G2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有眼利網民發現他們一家疑似搬了新居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a32306f5410810ed7ea5bbbbd45dc48/2023-10/G3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"可走到戶外讓小朋友放電。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9b84a7dfb6e9d2575daf5447cb45458/2023-10/G4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廚房佈置同樣有好多家庭照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0e3b94ce3ee28c79a2b7a156e25b1ce/2023-10/G6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳曾在家中為二仔Yannick開3歲生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ad08e3acfb1af83c84132c19d68e1bc/2023-10/ghlchan_364811473_18378877234012753_3480438667674994552_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當時就是在新居舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/774fe0f05ecdb37924a3e1f449e9b1c3/2023-10/ghlchan_365307576_18378877309012753_8530496833330820372_n_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地方非常寬敞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/476d40f45b298efb9d14f1823dae1531/2023-10/VS--ghlchanInstagram-0_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屋內亦可招呼很多客人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18189ae873394c9073206434f56bbf90/2023-10/VS--ghlchanInstagram-0_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳也經常在家附近拍片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24b31f8f07f08bee4a71e593979d4a84/2023-10/VS--ghlchanInstagram-0_01_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"之前鄭嘉穎拍完《披荊斬棘3》陪囝囝游水，也見到新居環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86e9437fd34f3969b61947b9a30f44e8/2023-10/VS--KevinChengkevinchengofficialInstagram-0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳凱琳積極洗底建立親切形象？</h2>\n<p>陳凱琳近日積極「洗底」，不時親自孭住大袋細袋落舖宣傳，事事親力親為。此外，她又慳家乘搭天星小輪過海，並與偶遇的粉絲合照，種種親民貼地舉動，瞬間融化了不少網民，紛紛轉軚大讚她真人隨和有禮，憑藉親和力成功博得大眾好感。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳四年抱三，為鄭嘉穎誕下三子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be2fd885daf4b43f562b5d2620798422/2026-08/343938333_792670445560677_15004516547311769_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前網上流傳陳凱琳搭電車時，將手袋及外套等物品放置在身旁座位，引發「霸位」爭議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65763b704a48a31872d2909baaf14871/2026-08/764906868_17939106720318583_8008007366208880994_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳將個人物品擺在電車座椅上，馬上被網民公審。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4c270983ae525e214107a159532dd3a/2026-08/764976401_17939106729318583_5355338072111628234_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳承認當日欣賞電影《蜘蛛俠：英雄重生》確實發生了「淋Cream事件」，事後已報警備案。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63e5e4942df13c44caf0da978a0a5426/2026-08/8ZIEoxzczKVUOygEXUXizJ9nGW0wuILdy1CFB8tQhQc.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"視帝鄭嘉穎看似過半退休生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62cd645f7ea2e854d8ef5b96d8773334/2026-08/ghlchan_1753883348_3688163297511387187_607052752.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳東奔西走賺錢養家，鄭嘉穎專注育兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d4ae374cc095d70f093ed6cff048194/2026-08/ghlchan_1739800793_3570030267710916842_607052752.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有陳凱琳的粉絲狠批鄭嘉穎，指平時幾乎都是由他照顧兒子，但在「出事」後竟「潛水」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fbe45a299a747ef7a3a3cdec13ad1c9/2026-08/kevincheng_official_1745586081_3618560783409693205_8667653738.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳一家人關係好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53dc04319b94abc6ad491048d4f4ff28/2023-05/ghlchan_349554237_1734594853662934_4897313802761642083_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳與胞弟是龍鳳胎姊弟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6048be4dffcd80f5548d8d2410c86a4/2024-04/G_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭嘉穎成為陳凱琳參賽的最強後盾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/158457af38b66b8e3c708144c65cd784/2026-03/3862089199541752684_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳婚後作不少新嘗試。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ad08e3acfb1af83c84132c19d68e1bc/2023-10/ghlchan_364811473_18378877234012753_3480438667674994552_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳分享大仔鄭承悅學習中文的過程，網民紛紛表示睇見都覺辛苦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c3ef92e9e74a8f44b18c10326c026c3/2026-05/3900948553932737557_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭嘉穎7歲大仔要讀補習班，力谷中文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71da22585de5b58758d8a5d72ad2a58b/2026-05/3900948552515247444_607052752.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳凱琳極錫大仔鄭承悅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c89b0ceca5ccd6b0c192732e006ee16/2026-07/11_1_18.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T10:19:06.545455+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":612,"images":44,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}